{"quest_id": 4593, "name": "暴れる山賊たち", "description": "山賊たちが暴れていると報告を\n受け、急ぎ駆けつけた王子たち。\n山賊を無力化せよ！\n初級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃5体）", "event": "魔界蟻と囚われた男達", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920068, "map_no": 3185, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 15, "exp": 140, "gold": 500, "drops": [{"card": 366, "c": 1}, {"card": 14, "c": 1}, {"item": 1005, "c": 1}], "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 14, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1500, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 1500, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 131, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097488, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 25, "global_id": 24, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 1, "level": 70, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 6000, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 180, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 55, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 157, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2100480, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 247, "global_id": 246, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 3200, "attack": 220, "base_hp": 3200, "base_attack": 220, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 40, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 162, "move_speed": 550.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097168, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 1, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 5000, "attack": 250, "base_hp": 5000, "base_attack": 250, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 200, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 91, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2106224, "race_id": 16, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 791, "global_id": 790, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1100, "attack": 250, "base_hp": 1100, "base_attack": 250, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_range": 100, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 166, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097552, "race_id": 16, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 29, "global_id": 28, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 54}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "山賊が暴れているという報告が\nあったのはここです。", "face": "l345427989d85"}, {"name": "ハリッサ", "text": "まったく、こんな時に……。\n私がしめてやらないといけない様ですね。", "face": "u25"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "ありがとうございます。ハリッサさん。\n今は、生き残った人々で\n助け合っていかなければならないのに……。", "face": "l345427989d85"}, {"name": "ハリッサ", "text": "モーティマはなにやってるんだか……。\nこの辺りの山賊は全部俺の手下だ、\nなんて豪語しておいて……全然ダメじゃない。", "face": "u25"}, {"name": "モーティマ", "text": "――ゲヘヘヘッ！！　オラァオラァッ！！\nどいつもこいつもぶっ飛ばしてやる！\n俺は山賊頭モーティマ様だぜぇ！！", "face": "u14"}, {"name": "ハリッサ", "text": "――ッ！？\nうそ……暴れている山賊って、\nモーティマだったの！？", "face": "u25"}, {"name": "モーティマ", "text": "うほおぉッ！？　王子じゃねぇか！\nよく見たら、お前すげえ良い身体してるな……。\nふん縛ってとっ捕まえてやるぜッ！！", "face": "u14"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "そんな……モーティマさんが\n王子を狙って襲いかかってくるなんて……。\n皆さん王子をお守りしてください！", "face": "l345427989d85"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "モーティマ", "text": "ぐ……せっかくイイ男が見つかったと\n思ったのに……！\nくそ、覚えてやがれッ！！", "face": "u14"}, {"name": "ハリッサ", "text": "イイ男って！？\nあ、こら待てモーティマ！\nどういうことか説明しろ！", "face": "u25"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "行ってしまいましたね……。\nいったい、どうしたのでしょうか……。", "face": "l345427989d85"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "あいつ、あんたらの仲間か？", "face": "u367"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "――あ、あなたは？", "face": "l345427989d85"}, {"name": "ジェイク", "text": "俺の名前はジェイク。冒険者だ。\nさっきの山賊には俺も襲われてな……。", "face": "u367"}, {"name": "ハリッサ", "text": "あいつ……！\nまた人さまに迷惑かける様な事をして……！", "face": "u25"}, {"name": "ジェイク", "text": "あぁ、それは気にしないでくれ。\nそれよりも、あいつの仲間って事なら言っておくが、\nあいつ、『普通』じゃないぜ。", "face": "u367"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "え、ええ……残念ながら。\n以前から王子を狙っていたのかもしれません。", "face": "l345427989d85"}, {"name": "ジェイク", "text": "いや、そういう意味じゃない。\nあいつも魔界アリに操られてしまっているって\nことなのさ。", "face": "u367"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920068_3185", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 167, "y": 131}, {"k": "m", "x": 809, "y": 361, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 708, "y": 371, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 605, "y": 353, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 512, "y": 330, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 422, "y": 367, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 310, "y": 388, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 203, "y": 358, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 111, "y": 365, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 234, "y": 282, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 260, "y": 196, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 346, "y": 151, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 426, "y": 102, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 522, "y": 57, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 612, "y": 44, "id": 213}, {"k": "m", "x": 696, "y": 79, "id": 214}, {"k": "m", "x": 759, "y": 137, "id": 215}, {"k": "m", "x": 782, "y": 261, "id": 216}, {"k": "r", "x": 855, "y": 281, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 899, "y": 315, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 837, "y": 424, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 749, "y": 421, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 485, "y": 273, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 246, "y": 437, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 179, "y": 420, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 69, "y": 316, "id": 307}, {"k": "r", "x": 144, "y": 302, "id": 308}, {"k": "r", "x": 327, "y": 255, "id": 309}, {"k": "r", "x": 374, "y": 218, "id": 310}, {"k": "r", "x": 428, "y": 181, "id": 311}, {"k": "r", "x": 500, "y": 166, "id": 312}]}, "start_cost": 10, "active": true}